cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Adaptive Runtime in academic or technical work, cite this repository."
title: "Adaptive Runtime"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic, zero-dependency TypeScript runtime for adaptive strategy
  orchestration across Node.js, browsers, and WinterCG edge runtimes. It selects
  exactly one strategy per run from explicit resource signals, budgets, and
  hysteresis policies.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The Adaptive Runtime Contributors"
version: 0.7.0
date-released: "2026-10-24"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/yusufgulerr/adaptive-runtime"
url: "https://github.com/yusufgulerr/adaptive-runtime"
keywords:
  - adaptive-runtime
  - policy-engine
  - resource-management
  - graceful-degradation
  - load-shedding
  - hysteresis
  - edge-computing
  - wintercg
  - typescript
  - zero-dependencies
